# Alt+Left goes back and Alt+Right goes forward, like H and L, and Alt+Shift+Left does nothing.
file <<END
Projects:
	Website:
		- Pick a theme
END
keys . j .
see › Projects › Website
keys <A-S-Left>
see › Projects › Website
keys <A-Left>
see › Projects
hide › Website
keys <A-Right>
see › Projects › Website
quit
